  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SNaP; Increasing Women&#x2019;s Participation in Decision-Making and Challenging Harmful Social Norms in Somalia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ensure that women have voice, choice and control over decisions that affect them by promoting women&apos;s voice in official processes  including transitional justice and local decision making, support women civil society, challenge discriminatory social norms and end harmful traditional practices.</narrative>
  </description>
